Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.789 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  for 21 seasons on american pickers mike  wolfe and frank fritz were one of tv's  most popular duos but now it's all over  here's everything you need to know about  the ugly feud that will change the way  you think about american pickers  in retrospect signs of a major schism in  the world of american pickers were  present way back in the spring of 2020.  at first season 21 of the series kept up  with the show's format of mike wolfe and  frank fritz traveling around the us  looking for treasure and moving on to  the next stop but starting with the  episode ghost to the west which  originally aired on september 7th  2020 fritz was nowhere to be seen  neither mike wolff nor store manager  daniel kobe gave any explanation for  fritz's extended absence and american  pickers first and barely acknowledged  that anything was different  even as danny was also suddenly promoted  to on location picking partner  due to pandemic lockdowns and  restrictions on tv production  season 22 of american pickers didn't hit  the air until january 2021  nearly a year after those initial fritz  free episodes debuted  with fritz still gone from the show  worried fans finally realized that the  american picker star might be gone for  good  finally in july 2021 frank fritz emerged  and broke his silence explaining why he  was no longer a part of the show that  had made him a reality tv superstar  in an interview with the sun fritz  claims he didn't leave american pickers  but rather stop participating in the  series due to medical reasons  he said i didn't leave the show i  finished shooting and then i had a  little back surgery and the pandemic  came  he also claimed at the time it's up to  the network whether i come back on the  show  on top of a condition with his back that  required surgery fritz also suffers from  crohn's disease  a serious and chronic inflammatory  disease that affects the digestive  system  he also recently lost more than 65  pounds which he attributed to exercising  more and quitting alcohol but though he  claimed his absence has had to do with  health issues fritz said his former  partner hasn't had his back  frank fritz said that his falling out  with mike wolf whom he says he's known  for more than 40 years  began quietly some time before news of  the american pickers feud reached the  public in 2021  fritz recounted to the sun i haven't  talked to mike in two years  he knew my back was messed up but he  didn't call me up and ask how i was  doing that's just how it is  the lack of communication seemed to make  some other issues of resentment bubble  up for fritz particularly tension with  wolf or the production of american  pickers  fritz alleged the show was tilted  towards him one thousand percent but  despite calling out wolf fred said he  accepted his role as plain second fiddle  as he explained  it's like you've got aerosmith and  there's steven tyler and he's the front  man  i found my spot i'm second and he's  number one on the show  that's no problem with me but maybe he  does have a problem you can't ride this  bike by yourself  you have to have two people to balance  it  on july 21st 2021 the history channel  made it official  a representative from the network told  entertainment weekly that fritz's long  tenure on american pickers had indeed  come to an end  according to the rep not only were there  no plans to bring fritz back to the  series but he also no longer fit into  the franchise's quote big picture  at that point mike will finally weighed  in on fritz's absence without  acknowledging any of the criticisms that  have been levied at him  he released a statement wishing his  former co-star well writing  i've known frank for as long as i can  remember he's been like a brother to me  the journey that frank danny and i  started back in 2009 like all of life  has come with its highs and lows  blessings and challenges but it has also  been the most rewarding  i will miss frank just like all of you  and i pray for the very best and all  good things for him on the next part of  his journey  you have to get used to change though i  mean that's that's the that's some of  the biggest arguments  you and i have when we're on the road is  change man  well mike wolf's statement on the  ongoing frank pritz affair was brief  polite and professional remarks from  another individual in the american  pickers family were a bit more dramatic  on august 2nd 2021 danny colby the third  cast member of american pickers released  a statement on the behind-the-scenes  drama via instagram  and she clearly picked aside alongside a  photo of herself and wolf colby wrote  i'm proud of how you have handled the  last 12 years and look forward to many  more years of rolling around this big  blue marble together  i'm truly saddened for the loss of frank  on the show i'm incredibly sad for his  struggles i wish things could have been  different but we must be accountable for  our actions when we cause instability or  pain and suffering to others  colby further alluded to the  behind-the-scenes situation by saying  frank caused so much pain for himself  that it has been hard to watch  i truly hope frank receives all the help  he needs  by august 4th 2021 fritz returned to the  sun to issue another blistering  statement calling out his former co-host  once again  not mincing words in response to wolf's  statement on his departure from the  series fritz said  mike's statement was both somebody wrote  it out for him i don't believe in ten  years he said five nice things to me you  know  unless he was cutting somebody else down  and we were both laughing fritz also  told the sun that he's not done fighting  for a way back to the spotlight  thousands of people want me back they've  got a petition to get me back on the  show  i could go either way and find a new  show have something new and have just as  much fun  so look out for that possibility frank  fritz fans as for mike wolfe the  american pickers host did not  immediately respond to fritz's comments  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  you

